How about scrolls of charging that you can also get while polypiling? If
I am reading the spoilers correctly, the probability of getting a
?oCharging is 0.015. The probability of *not* getting a single charging
scroll in a single zap is (1 - 0.015)^20 or about 74%.

However, your wand usually has more charges. In 5 zaps this probability
drops to 22%. In other words, if your wand starts out (x:5), there is
78% chance that you will get at least one charging scroll by the time
you run out of charges.

